SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the four corrections to the defs, and the restructuring of the abstract
    bases and the texture paths
  - the French translation
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The five buildings, their stats, their
recreation jobs, their ten textures and the Workshop preview are Chicken
Plucker's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1842663639

Chicken Plucker never declared a licence for them, so none is granted here and
none can be. They are redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned
mods - explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request. The
B19-to-1.0 update the mod is descended from is dninemfive's.

If Chicken Plucker or dninemfive asks for this to be taken down, it comes down.
Immediately, and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
